cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "rtfreporter" in publications use:'
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
title: 'rtfreporter: Clinical RTF Reporting Toolkit for Tables, Listings and Figures'
abstract: A standalone toolkit for generating Rich Text Format (RTF) reports used
  in clinical trial deliverables -- Tables, Listings and Figures (TFLs) -- with a
  functional, pipe-friendly API, multi-section headers and footers, and clinical-style
  borders. Depends on no other RTF-generation package.
authors:
- family-names: Masui
  given-names: Yoichi
  email: ichi.r.pro@gmail.com
repository-code: https://github.com/ichirio/rtfreporter
url: https://ichirio.github.io/rtfreporter/
keywords:
- clinical trials
- RTF
- tables listings and figures
- R package

